# Shell scripts and the Dockerfile MUST keep LF endings.
#
# This repo is developed on Windows with core.autocrlf=true, which would
# otherwise check these out with CRLF. A CRLF shebang breaks a script inside a
# Linux container with a cryptic "exec /app/docker-entrypoint.sh: no such file
# or directory" — the interpreter is read as "/bin/sh\r", which doesn't exist.
*.sh        text eol=lf
Dockerfile  text eol=lf
*.dockerfile text eol=lf
